186
00:13:21,381 --> 00:13:28,018
Step 8: your configuration. Replay labs/run
ref/professional-config and show the

187
00:13:28,058 --> 00:13:28,937
file again.

188
00:13:38,277 --> 00:13:43,307
Go through the file section by section and,
for each setting, do what this video did

189
00:13:43,347 --> 00:13:48,196
for practices: say the reason. A setting
whose reason you can't give goes back on

190
00:13:48,236 --> 00:13:52,060
