level the question is asked.

238
00:17:12,626 --> 00:17:14,676
Let's land this, in your own words.

239
00:17:15,016 --> 00:17:19,134
A practice needs its mechanism; without it
the practice is dropped under pressure.

240
00:17:19,474 --> 00:17:24,159
A commit is the unit of revert, cherry-pick,
bisect and review, and a squash makes

241
00:17:24,199 --> 00:17:25,715
the pull request that unit.

242
00:17:26,055 --> 00:17:30,285
Each anti-pattern comes from a wrong model,
and the correction is the missing fact.

243
00:17:30,625 --> 00:17:35,675
Review exchanges knowledge; size and speed
decide its value; it replaces neither

244
00:17:35,715 --> 00:17:36,757
checks nor rules.

245
00:17:37,097 --> 00:17:41,956
A message convention turns history into data
that can be queried, and it cannot make

246
00:17:41,996 --> 00:17:42,831
a message true.

